PR #1923 is open as a draft against `claude/rel-20261102a`. It adds the switch `doubleClick.pitLabelStopsAttributeEditorFirst` (ON). Nobody has opened it in AutoCAD, so BUG-430 is not fixed.

- **What changes:** with `doubleClick.opensEditWindow` ON, a double-click on a linked pit label registers the pit for Edit Pit before AutoCAD's attribute editor opens. A frame or Xref plan that only surrounds the label no longer makes CE back off. With `opensEditWindow` left OFF, nothing changes.
- **Files:** `DoubleClickSettings.cs`, `DoubleClickAttributeEditorStopRule.cs`, `DoubleClickHitTest.cs`, `CompoundEditModeService.cs`, a new `Bug430PitLabelStopsAttributeEditorTests.cs` and a `REGRESSION_LOG.md` entry.
